  "question": {
    "text": "The radius of the circle touching the line <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math> at <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1,3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and intersecting <math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math> orthogonally is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> units",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> units",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math> units",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> units",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "Let the equation of the circle is <math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />which is orthogonal to <math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math><br />Now,&nbsp;<math><msub><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> implies <math><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br />Hence, the equation of the circle is<br /><math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>9</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>16</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>81</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>16</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>18</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>16</mn></mrow></mfrac></msqrt></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>"
  }
}